<title>USA: Snyder Q3 pro forma net income rises.</title>
<headline>Snyder Q3 pro forma net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>SNYDER COMMUNICATIONS INC</p>
<p>				 3 Mos ended 9/30     9 Mos ended 9/30</p>
<p>				    1995     1996     1995     1996</p>
<p> Revenues		    $ 11,937 $ 21,465 $ 25,917 $ 56,326</p>
<p> Pro forma net income	 1,372	895    2,557    3,434</p>
<p> Pro forma net EPS	     0.05     0.03     0.09     0.12</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs		 29,458   29,766   29,458   29,562</p>
<p>		 (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company completed IPO on September 25, 1996. Results are on a pro forma basis to reflect operations as if the offering had taken place at the commencement of the period.</p>
